error[E0113]: a label cannot be a reserved word
 --> test-code/errors/front/E0113-label-invalid.mu:2:5
  |
1 | main :: proc() Int ->
2 |     :return
  |     ^^^^^^^ this is a reserved word
3 |     return 0
  |
  = note: a label is a ':' directly followed by a name, and the name is not a reserved word
